# The GitHub Actions release workflow is kept on disk but out of git: the
# token this repo was pushed with has `repo` scope but not `workflow`, and
# GitHub refuses any push that creates or updates a file under
# .github/workflows without it. Releases are cut directly instead:
#
#   python3 tools/modkit.py pack battle_dex -o battle_dex-<version>.zip
#   gh release create v<version> --title <version> battle_dex-<version>.zip
#
# To switch to CI releases: `gh auth refresh -s workflow` (needs an
# interactive shell), delete this file, then commit .github/.
.github/
